{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your ultimate goal is to craft the <strong>omega</strong> element.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You start with the  <strong>generate </strong> command, which creates an <strong>alpha</strong> element.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You unlock new features from <strong>shop</strong> with <strong>buy</strong> command. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create new elements from the existing ones using <strong>pack, merge</strong> and<strong> cut\u00a0</strong>commands. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting recipes are hidden by default. When the elements of the recipes have been present in the storage, they become visible. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create custom commands to automate your game. For example '<strong>g = generate generage</strong>' creates command <strong>g</strong>, which executes <strong>generate</strong>-command twice.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting trees are procedurally generated. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scoring </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Typing Speed </strong> - Faster typing speed yields a better score. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command Efficiency </strong> - A smaller command count yields a better score. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Storage Efficiency </strong> -  A smaller storage value yields a better score.  </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2916150/0534d2b7cbcf15f409254498056fc42fa3abbdd7.jpg"},{"name":"Packing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2916150/1ac0fd1868e14e47a12f6b1641247de7c70fdac7.jpg"},{"name":"Merging","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub